    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH1e0879-start">
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.3" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">What the Annals sorts out properly</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.4" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">concerns others and oneself.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.5" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">That by means of which it sorts out properly what concerns others and oneself</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.6" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">are kind-heartedness and righteousness.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.7" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">By means of kind-heartedness one brings comfort to others,</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.8" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">by means of righteousness one straightens out oneself.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.9" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">So the essential meaning of kind-heartedness is concerned with others</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.10" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">whereas the essential meaning of righteousness is concerned with oneself.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.11" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">Speech names these in order to distinguish between them.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.12" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">The relation between 'kind-heartedness' and 'others'</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.13" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">and the relation between 'rigteousness' and 'oneself'</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.14" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">must definitely be properly understood.</seg> 
<seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2024-01-25T19:30:00.314+09:00">The hoi polloi do not understand these relations:</seg> 
<seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2024-01-25T19:30:17.555+09:00">and then by means of kind-heartedness they try to enrich themselves,</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.15" modified="2024-01-25T19:30:00.314+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1e0879-en-87939c46">The hoi polloi do not understand these relations:</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.16" modified="2024-01-25T19:30:17.555+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1e0879-en-87939c46">and then by means of kind-heartedness they try to enrich themselves,</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.17" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">and by means of righteousness they try to provide for others.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.18" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">Since they get the place%3Eobject of their actions wrong, and they go against the underlying principles</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.19" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">and few of them end with anything other than misrule.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.20" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">Therefore no one aims for misrule</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.21" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">but by and large they constantly practise misrule.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.22" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">As a matter of principle, in this way they are in the dark on the distinction between 'others' and 'oneself'</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.23" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">and they fail to reflect on wherin kind-heartedness and righteousness consist.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.24" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">So then, the Annals practise the method of kind-heartedness and righteousness.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.25" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">The method of kind-heartedness consists in taking good care of others,</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.26" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">and it does not consist in taking good care of oneself.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.27" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">The method of righteousness consists in controlling oneself properly,</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.28" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">it does not consist in controlling others properly.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.29" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">If one does not control oneself properly</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.30" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">then even if one were to control others properly</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.31" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">we cannot concede that one counts as righteous.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.32" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">If others are not exposed to his good care,</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.33" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">then even if he takes abundant care of himself</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.34" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">we do not concede that the person counts as kind-hearted.</seg> 
<seg resp="#CH" xml:lang="en" corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_008-6a.35" modified="2020-04-22T17:09:58.759+09:00">In ancient times</seg> 
                    
                <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:22:29.962+09:00">The moral significance of ruler/subject, father/son and husband/wife relations</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:33:14.369+09:00">always derives from the basic principle of the Yin/Yang relation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:29:40.548+09:00">No object is without links,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:30:40.924+09:00">and each link contains the Yin/Yang relation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:30:57.746+09:00">Yang links into Yin</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:31:02.747+09:00">Yin links into Yang</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:31:23.451+09:00">husbandhood links into wifehood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:31:35.535+09:00">wifehood links into husbandhood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:31:45.163+09:00">fatherhood links into sonhood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:31:56.535+09:00">sonhood links into fatherhood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:32:14.707+09:00">rulership links into subjecthood</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:32:46.001+09:00">subjecthood links into rulership.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:35:00.957+09:00">The Way of Yin is that it does not act independently:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:37:12.846+09:00">In its beginning it does not get to arise by its own initiative</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:37:21.251+09:00">in its ending it does not get to participate in merit:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#guest" modified="2025-07-07T17:39:34.6+09:00">its moral significance is in linking into the other (the Yang).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T17:43:54.149+09:00">Therefore the subject shares in the merits of the ruler.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T17:44:10.733+09:00">the son shares in the merits of the father</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T17:44:33.47+09:00">the wife shares in the merits of  the husband:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T17:45:02.264+09:00">Yin shares in the merits of Yang.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T17:50:09.259+09:00">Earth shares in the merits of Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T17:51:06.097+09:00">Promoting some to higher positions</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T17:52:23.197+09:00">is to hold down others in lower positions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T17:53:00.27+09:00">When there those one is screening off on the left</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T17:55:26.325+09:00">there will be those whom one pulls up on the right;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T18:10:33.599+09:00">When there are some desires one forever increases</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T17:57:55.911+09:00">there will be other desires one ever more represses:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T18:00:00.029+09:00">as one is increasingly indulging in some desires, one represses the prohibitions against these.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T18:10:41.663+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0879_CHANT_012-6a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-07T18:10:48.123+09:00"> </seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
